 because it:\n- Immediately stakes a claim in the center\n- Opens diagonals for the f1-bishop and d1-queen\n- Allows for quick kingside development\n- Leads to dynamic, tactical positions where White often gets early initiative\n- Is statistically one of the most successful opening moves\n\nAnswer: P: e2-e4"}
