advantage, passive play guarantees defeat. I need to create activity and potential threats. Advancing d2-d4 fights for the center, opens lines for my remaining pieces, and creates the most complications. It's the principled chess move in this situation - when losing, complicate!\n\n**Answer:** P: d2-d4"}
